


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_e6baf7af:


    "——正月。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b1533596:


    "平静的午后。初次参拜之后的归途。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_30476b47:


    "离神社越远，人就越少。虽说是正月三天假，但是和平常也没什么不同。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_2135da28:


    "即使如此，沉浸在清爽新年气息里的四人露出了爽朗的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a70b538c:


    "其中的圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_cf8fd0dc:



    voice "2MI_0106"
    miyako "「～～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_146ddaad:



    voice "2HI_0127"
    hina "「鹰冈同学是第一次体验日本的正月吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_de1d36a3:



    voice "2MI_0107"
    miyako "「不，并不是这样的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_9ea3e758:



    voice "2FU_0089"
    fumi "「今天还有人穿着盛装，还有摊子，让人不禁东张西望呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_f8f2ae90:



    voice "2MI_0108"
    miyako "「是的！色彩大混战！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_ab90792b:


    "露出了得意的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a6ef86fe:



    voice "2RI_0118"
    rin "「色彩大混战吗。鹰冈同学的用词可真有趣呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a8f38c89:



    voice "2MI_0109"
    miyako "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c7161939:


    "这个镇子虽然什么都没有，但是却有正儿八经的神社。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_5e6bdc52:


    "虽说这个神社只是有市里的访客来参拜的程度，但是正如文所说，盛装加上锦旗，镇子的色彩比平常丰富了不少。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_1580e522:


    "对于尚不习惯彩色世界的圣夜子来说，大混战就是她的真心话了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_269d5e22:



    voice "2FU_0090"
    fumi "「正月里穿盛装，真不错呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_80b43341:


    "看到对面街道上同样初次参拜完，身着盛装走在归途上的一群人，文嘀咕了句。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_ab9363b7:



    voice "2RI_0119"
    rin "「和服不是很麻烦吗？搞不懂怎么穿」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_6984650d:



    voice "2HI_0128"
    hina "「我妈妈知道怎么穿哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_3650c340:



    voice "2FU_0091"
    fumi "「真的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_60ba3505:



    voice "2HI_0129"
    hina "「嗯，毕竟我家里是和服店」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_eb12fdf7:



    voice "2RI_0120"
    rin "「我都没有这种衣服」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_56ddcac6:



    voice "2HI_0130"
    hina "「好像也提供租赁服务」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_405c9a32:



    voice "2FU_0092"
    fumi "「哇哇哇！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_ba98b2d3:


    "文因为梦想突然变得现实起来而兴奋。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_7e61d054:



    voice "2FU_0093"
    fumi "「明年我们也来穿和服吧！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_0ed3f010:



    voice "2RI_0121"
    rin "「就算你这么说」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_bcf34991:



    voice "2FU_0094"
    fumi "「来吧来吧，把头发也扎起来吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c3f1d2fc:



    voice "2HI_0131"
    hina "「反正你们还没穿过吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_f979a33c:



    voice "2RI_0122"
    rin "「丹前（一种类似和服的日本传统室内服）？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b296069f:



    voice "2FU_0095RE"
    fumi "「丹前不是和服啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_67b0e213:



    voice "2HI_0132"
    hina "「凡事都要经历一下吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d3398952:



    voice "2RI_0123"
    rin "「嗯。阳菜是去年的七五三节之后就没穿过了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a2567926:



    voice "2HI_0133"
    hina "「去年个鬼啊！更早之前！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_73bf3358:



    voice "2MI_0110"
    miyako "「啊哈哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_aac29c43:


    "圣夜子被两人的相声逗得笑喷了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_fce3fa04:



    voice "2HI_0134"
    hina "「对了。明年鹰冈同学来我家吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_4bf2da81:



    voice "2MI_0111"
    miyako "「诶，真的好吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a5d7e688:



    voice "2HI_0135"
    hina "「我觉得你一个人留在宿舍里挺寂寞的。你说过你不怎么回老家」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_3e9fa0cf:



    voice "2MI_0112"
    miyako "「是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_ceb9e441:



    voice "2FU_0096"
    fumi "「也请来我家玩吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_f9f2723d:



    voice "2HI_0136"
    hina "「当然，要看鹰冈同学的意愿」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_289c4c95:


    "文在旁边点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_788feb0b:



    voice "2MI_0113"
    miyako "「嗯，我很乐意」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_27e05500:


    "尽管明年的事儿还不好说，她们正畅谈着下一次过年的事情。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_f59192af:



    voice "2FU_0097"
    fumi "「刚才抽的签结果如何？我抽的是吉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_fbebcdd6:



    voice "2HI_0137"
    hina "「我抽的是小吉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_10a6eadd:



    voice "2RI_0124"
    rin "「毕竟人也小」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_4b68ea50:



    voice "2HI_0138"
    hina "「这有个鬼的关系！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_bae888c7:


    "阳菜弹开了砰砰地敲针织帽的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c49efd36:



    voice "2RI_0125"
    rin "「小吉和吉，哪个更好？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_51bb62ec:



    voice "2FU_0098"
    fumi "「大吉，吉，中吉，小吉，末吉，凶，或者大吉，中吉，小吉，吉，末吉，凶，哪里的神社都是这样的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_e203cd1d:



    voice "2FU_0098a"
    fumi "「那边的神社会是哪种呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_3f8c8517:



    voice "2HI_0139"
    hina "「哎，是这样的吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_224cd10c:



    voice "2FU_0099"
    fumi "「伦呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b98ae76a:



    voice "2FU_0100"
    fumi "「绪方同学呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_73e982bf:



    voice "2RI_0126"
    rin "「呵呵呵。我当然是大吉。真不愧是我」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_cc667da7:


    "伦很得意地从大衣的右侧的口袋里拿出大吉的签摊开。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_541467d1:



    voice "2FU_0101"
    fumi "「哇，好厉害！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_6565a901:



    voice "2HI_0140"
    hina "「不，哪里厉害了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_507071a1:


    "阳菜说着，把手伸进伦左边的口袋里，拿出一叠纸。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_8b20f9f9:



    voice "2RI_0127"
    rin "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_8f4a14bf:


    "是纸签。有小吉还有中吉，总之除了大吉还有好几张。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a65bc608:



    voice "2RI_0128"
    rin "「你看到了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_97a4afaf:



    voice "2HI_0141"
    hina "「看到了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_12838152:



    voice "2FU_0102"
    fumi "「我听说可以重抽」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_e602a448:



    voice "2HI_0142"
    hina "「那你到底抽了多少次啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_47232447:



    voice "2RI_0129"
    rin "「一直到我抽到为止」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_8bb3e9a7:



    voice "2FU_0103"
    fumi "「哈哈哈。鹰冈同学呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_37cb6043:



    voice "2MI_0114"
    miyako "「我的是凶」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_baa98b14:


    "圣夜子一脸天真烂漫笑容的啪地展开了签，反而搞得旁边的人一脸震惊。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_2b1c26da:



    voice "2RI_0130"
    rin "「去重抽吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_dfe559c9:



    voice "2FU_0104"
    fumi "「要回去把签打个结吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_20f0460b:



    voice "2MI_0115"
    miyako "「没关系的。我还是第一次抽签，就把它带回去作纪念吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_6a34f02a:



    voice "2HI_0143"
    hina "「签，签什么的毕竟只是个建议而已。就是让你过日子的时候注意一下而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_a_ce9e147b:



    voice "2MI_0116"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_984dbadd:



    voice "2MI_0117"
    miyako "「是小吉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_120af01f:


    "圣夜子打开签子。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_fd1bfe47:



    voice "2FU_0105"
    fumi "「啊，你没把签打结绑在树枝上啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_84aeb018:



    voice "2MI_0118"
    miyako "「没有。因为我是第一次抽签所以想带回去作纪念」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_b2a71ec2:



    voice "2HI_0144"
    hina "「小吉的话，和我一样呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_0dadf369:



    voice "2RI_0131"
    rin "「长得明明不小」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_b_a5c26505:



    voice "2HI_0145"
    hina "「我不都说了和身材没关系吗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_92f10e05:



    voice "2MI_0119"
    miyako "「是大吉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_c122dfb3:


    "圣夜子笑眯眯地打开签。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_73228c19:



    voice "2FU_0106"
    fumi "「哇，拍手拍手」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_662e7362:



    voice "2RI_0132"
    rin "「抽了几次？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_d1826794:



    voice "2MI_0120"
    miyako "「1次就出了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_78b19af5:



    voice "2HI_0146"
    hina "「和伦不一样，这是真真正正的大吉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_b553c7da:



    voice "2RI_0133"
    rin "「大吉没有高低贵贱之分！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_957d4d0e:



    voice "2FU_0107"
    fumi "「今年肯定也会是好运的一年」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_c_ff7671e2:



    voice "2MI_0121"
    miyako "「谢谢你们」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_88713aa1:



    voice "2HI_0147"
    hina "「早上做新年礼拜，中午做初次参拜。不觉得我们会受到什么天罚吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_8601a517:



    voice "2RI_0134"
    rin "「在教堂里拍手参拜（神道教的礼仪）的人现在说什么呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_bbc01e20:



    voice "2HI_0148"
    hina "「啊，那个是顺便，顺便的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_0178f379:



    voice "2RI_0135"
    rin "「叫你这么一说神社和寺庙也有混在一起的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_601a6d7b:



    voice "2HI_0149"
    hina "「不一样吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_a3642ca1:



    voice "2RI_0136"
    rin "「毕竟神社是神道教的，寺庙是佛教的。顺便一提，寺庙是不能拍手的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_8821058c:



    voice "2HI_0150"
    hina "「啊，刚才，拍手了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_3d694fff:



    voice "2FU_0108"
    fumi "「刚才参拜的是神社所以没关系」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_f9c84e61:



    voice "2HI_0151"
    hina "「哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_29c41690:



    voice "2FU_0109"
    fumi "「但是确实是在同时信仰不同的神明大人」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_f4bc3335:



    voice "2RI_0137"
    rin "「你除了我之外不能信仰其他的神明？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_30867a7d:



    voice "2HI_0152"
    hina "「啊，是课上讲过的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_a622ae91:


    "十诫。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_be8efd77:



    voice "2RI_0138"
    rin "「不也挺好的嘛？至少考圣叶不一定要是基督徒」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_fc0a79b7:



    voice "2FU_0110"
    fumi "「既过圣诞节，还去初次参拜。感觉你好像只会去活动一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_8c706c67:



    voice "2RI_0139"
    rin "「说是很日本风好像确实是很日本作风」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_16b8539b:



    voice "2RI_0140"
    rin "「文你虽然相信天使的存在但并不是基督徒吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_5c846a7f:



    voice "2RI_0141"
    rin "「浅生相信天使的存在却不是基督徒吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_f7efca93:



    voice "2FU_0111RE"
    fumi "「我家里还有佛坛」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_d2982933:



    voice "2HI_0153"
    hina "「我家也是」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_1bd67685:



    voice "2RI_0142"
    rin "「你不能为了自己去制作偶像（注：宗教里的寄托物，如佛像或雕塑）」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_2fd892c6:


    "这也是十诫。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_d2015645:



    voice "2RI_0143"
    rin "「但是，我的神明是真实的，你的只是偶像，这是由谁来定夺的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_a9df3a69:



    voice "2HI_0154"
    hina "「圣战吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_5df882a3:



    voice "2RI_0144"
    rin "「别冷不丁地说这么恐怖的事儿」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_8845250c:


    "确实。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_ba3d8565:



    voice "2MI_0122"
    miyako "「只是叫法不同，还是一个东西」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_8d7d1b92:


    "圣夜子突然开了口。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_76524e09:



    voice "2RI_0145"
    rin "「嗯，是类似本地垂迹说那种吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_561db5a3:



    voice "2MI_0123"
    miyako "「就是字面上的意思」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_d32aa85a:



    voice "2HI_0155"
    hina "「啥？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_69e4c1c9:



    voice "2RI_0146"
    rin "「啊，把背面朝上的卡片翻过来，如果是同一张卡的话就能拿到那张卡的玩意儿」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_e840de5c:



    voice "2HI_0156"
    hina "「…………我是不会上当的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_fd482456:



    voice "2RI_0147"
    rin "「神佛习合」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_6ddf898c:



    voice "2HI_0157"
    hina "「神和佛祖聚在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_cc7bbbd8:



    voice "2RI_0148"
    rin "「嗯，阳菜这样就行了。于是，鹰冈同学？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_d643b07b:



    voice "2HI_0158"
    hina "「喂！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_fb7181af:



    voice "2MI_0124"
    miyako "「宗教是人想了解天地才创造出来的东西。但是不管怎么解释这个世界，眼前的这个世界都不会发生改变」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_2b738712:



    voice "2RI_0149"
    rin "「我和你都看着同样的神明。只是取的名字不同而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_b95d5c82:



    voice "2MI_0125"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_a8847c6b:


    "被人乱起名的那一方的意见。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_1fa29828:


    "飞天，天女，Houris，女武神，飞棍，蛾人……不，最后2个是多余的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_9dc11e0a:


    "总之，数不胜数。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_c2ec5a13:


    "她(天使)是存在的。只有这个是事实，其他的都是解释。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_a67e3850:



    voice "2FU_0112"
    fumi "「鹰冈同学不相信神明和天使吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_2b52f2b4:



    voice "2MI_0126"
    miyako "「我没见过神明不太清楚，不过天使是有的哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_018577a8:


    "哦，要说出来了么？"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_1436e790:



    voice "2FU_0113"
    fumi "「你，见到过天使吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_98e61f86:



    voice "2MI_0127"
    miyako "「……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_92112cc0:


    "啊，这孩子，只是下意识地说出来的么。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_5c503570:



    voice "2MI_0128"
    miyako "「是，感觉好像看到过……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_598b54a5:



    voice "2FU_0114"
    fumi "「那个！我！小的时候看到过天使！在一个下雪天，天使，天使把我的鞋子！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_09_d_3a03614d:



